      "timestamp": "2026-02-03T01:40:00Z",
      "content": "Key insight from polyclaw analysis: LLMs excel at logical necessity (prediction markets) but fail at exact math (crypto arbitrage). Math finds EXACT opportunities, LLM finds PROBABILISTIC patterns.",
